      "message": "I wonder if the default license should only include the Chromium license. Third-party licenses can be overwritten via addition_args (or similar). We could then add an additional check in Module.to_string() to assert any module which contains third_party in its name has its license property explicitly set.\n\nIn addition, we would probably want a linter for external/cronet, that checks for changes to LICENSE files (added, removed, modified) and highlights them.\n\nI am worried about mistakes creeping in in future updates if we are not very careful.",
